    "message": "Keep a small Run saved before Checkpoints recorded the model version\n\nfixtures/saved_runs/engine-v1-small is h00_small_replay, 90 minutes long,\ncomputed to minute 60 on main and on a child forked at minute 30. It was\nbuilt with scripts/build_saved_run_fixture.py in a worktree of 6d5662c,\nbefore Checkpoints recorded the whole-model version, so it is a Run as\nevery earlier save is. Tests of reading Runs of older models use it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01K4QyYRukuCLBerKa4UYj4y",
    "parents": [
