    "message": "Document Runs of another model version and the L9 lane\n\narchitecture.md, project-persistence.md and api-reference.md describe the\nwhole-model version, the rule for saves without it, the view-only path,\nthe rounding to saved points and the run_model_view_only error.\ndocs/rust-port/lanes/l9-view-only.md records what moved, the checks and\nwhat L10 and L11 take over.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01K4QyYRukuCLBerKa4UYj4y",
